  "notes": "Units interpreted as millimeters. Best-effort revolved flanged hub: OD 76 flange to z=18, rear boss OD 48 from z=18 to 26, stepped central bore/counterbore ID 38 x 16 deep stepping to through bore ID 28. Four equally spaced axial counterbored bolt holes are placed on the Ø56 bolt circle; the drawing shows Ø5.3 pilot with Ø7.8 counterbore depth 4, assumed from the front face. Internal R2 at the front counterbore-to-through-bore shoulder is recorded but the revolved segment model represents it as a sharp step. A visible radial/cross drilled Ø5 hole lies in section A-A at 30 degrees, located 7 mm from the front face and opening between the outside/inner bore; this non-coaxial radial hole cannot be directly encoded in the revolved segment schema and is therefore recorded in dimensions/notes rather than geometry."
